      "message": "Just one more rustification and then all these functions are nicely implemented in purely functional style:\n\nYou can use `flat_map` to flatten the nested iterator slice and their chunks into one iterator:\n```\n    iterate_adv_data(bytes, COMPLETE_LIST_128_BIT_SERVICE_UUIDS)\n        .flat_map(|slice| slice.chunks(16))\n        .filter_map(|chunk| Uuid::try_from(chunk.to_vec()).ok().map(|uuid| uuid.uu))\n        .collect()\n```\n\nThanks for rustifying!",
